<Testimonial
  title="Testimonial | Enevald Horve"
  heading="Enevald Horve"
  description="Enevald, 60, from Norway on how the chanting and meditation of monastic life in Belgium helped him set down years of anger."
  detail="11th European Ordination Program participant"
  portrait={img2026074}
  portraitAlt="Portrait of Enevald Horve"
>
  <p>
    My name is Enevald. I come from Norway and I am 60 years old. Before coming here I was a lay person. The monastic
    life in Belgium, the chanting, and the meditation have helped me calm down and become happier.
  </p>
  <p>
    I used to carry a lot of anger. The teachings and the daily life as a monk have helped me become a better person and
    more peaceful every day. I especially enjoy the chanting and meditation here in Belgium, they continue to go better
    and better every day. The alms round is also something I truly appreciate. We receive respect from the lay people,
    and we return that respect through the blessing.
  </p>
  <p>Watch the full video <a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mA6R8_K2Kb0" target="_blank" rel="noopener">on YouTube</a></p>
</Testimonial>
